  "ingameEffects": [
    {
      "id": "lucia_elowen-ex_special_attack-symphony_of_the_reaper_daybreak",
      "source": "ex_special_attack",
      "sourceId": "lucia_elowen-ex_special_attack",
      "label": "Symphony of the Reaper - Daybreak (EX Special Attack)",
      "description": "With enough Energy, press EX Special Attack to activate: This EX Special Attack is a Harmony. When activated, it summons an Ethereal figure that delivers a powerful forward slash in a line, dealing Ether DMG.\n\nWhen Lucia uses any Harmony, all squad members gain the Darkbreaker state. While in Darkbreaker state, Sheer Force increases by 12. Every 200 points of Lucia's initial Max HP grants an additional amount of Sheer Force. The Darkbreaker state can increase Sheer Force by up to a maximum value, lasting 20s and repeated triggers reset the duration. When Lucia's initial Max HP reaches 24,000, the above bonus effect reaches its maximum value.\n\nWhen any Harmony deals DMG, Lucia increases the final attack's DMG by an additional percentage of her Max HP. If she activates this EX Special Attack while in the Dream state and under the effect of Ether Veil: Wellspring, Ether Veil: Wellspring duration is extended by 16s. After activating her EX Special Attack, Lucia can immediately follow up with the 5th hit of her Basic Attack. If not in the Dream state, Lucia gains 60 Dream Points upon using this Harmony. Character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
      "shortDescription": "All squad members Sheer Force is increased based on Lucia's initial HP.",
      "target": "team",
