        "description": "With enough Energy, press [EX] to activate:\n\nThis /bEX Special Attack//b is a /bHarmony//b. When activated, it summons an Ethereal figure that delivers a powerful forward slash in a line, dealing Ether DMG.\n\nWhen Lucia uses any /bHarmony//b, all squad members gain the /bDarkbreaker//b state. While in /bDarkbreaker//b state, Sheer Force increases by 12. Every 200 points of Lucia's initial Max HP grants an additional amount of Sheer Force. The /bDarkbreaker//b state can increase Sheer Force by a set amount up to a maximum value, lasting 20s and repeated triggers reset the duration. When Lucia's initial Max HP reaches 24,000, the above bonus effect reaches its maximum value.\n\nWhen any /bHarmony//b deals DMG, Lucia increases the final attack's DMG by an additional percentage of her Max HP.\n\nIf she activates this /bEX Special Attack//b while in the /bDream//b state and under the effect of /bEther Veil: Wellspring//b, /bEther Veil: Wellspring//b duration is extended by 16s. After activating her /bEX Special Attack//b, Lucia can immediately follow up with the 5th hit of her /bBasic Attack//b.\n\nIf not in the /bDream//b state, Lucia gains 60 /bDream Points//b upon using this /bHarmony//b. Character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
