        "id": "lucia-ultimate-charge_great_armor",
        "name": "Charge, Great Armor! (Ultimate)",
        "description": "When Decibel Rating is at Maximum, press [ULTIMATE] to activate:\n\nThis /bUltimate//b is a /bHarmony//b. When activated, Lucia summons an Ethereal figure and rides it forward in a charge. Holding a directional button allows her to steer and extend the charge, up to 3s. During the charge, Anti-Interrupt Level is increased, DMG taken is reduced by 40%, and when Lucia takes fatal DMG, she remains in battle with HP not dropping below 1.\n\nWhen the charge ends, Lucia unleashes a powerful strike in a large area around her, dealing Ether DMG. A /bQuick Assist//b is triggered when this skill hits an enemy, and after the skill is used, it leaves behind a /bStarlight Convergence//b. /bStarlight Convergence//b lasts 8s. While inside /bStarlight Convergence//b, the currently active character gains HP regeneration equal to a percentage of Lucia's Max HP per second. This effect ends 4s after leaving the /bStarlight Convergence//b or immediately when switching out.\n\nAfter activation, if Lucia is in the /bDream//b state and /bEther Veil: Wellspring//b is active, /bEther Veil: Wellspring//b duration is extended by 32s. If not in the /bDream//b state, Lucia gains 100 /bDream Points//b upon using this /bHarmony//b. If she is in the /bDream//b state when activating this /bHarmony//b, she will gain 100 /bDream Points//b and re-enter /bDream//b state the next time she exits it. This effect cannot be stacked. Character is invulnerable while performing the powerful strike.",
